    chore(test): drop non-portable absolute path from the scaffold error-contract test
    
    The only /home/kara literal in the tracked tree was the third schema-lookup candidate added with 553620a. This repo is public, so a personal absolute path does not belong in it: the two portable candidates (H3_PROTOCOL_DIR override, sibling ../protocol checkout) already cover the local and CI layouts, and the test skips when neither is present.
    
    Addresses DF-H3-SHIM-FOREMAN-3
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
